(ROOT/'index.html').write_text('''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>重新设计 · 四份阅读样本</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="gallery.css?v=2"><script src="concepts.js?v=2" defer></script></head><body class="gallery" data-view="desktop"><div class="gallery-wrap"><header class="gallery-nav"><a href="index.html">十一 / DESIGN STUDIES</a><span>第二轮设计 · 2026</span></header><section class="gallery-intro"><div class="overline">FOUR DIRECTIONS. ONE READING EXPERIENCE.</div><h1>换一种，<br>看得舒服的方式。</h1><p>四种完整的阅读风格。同一组内容，不同的版式、配色与节奏。<br>点开样本，试试导航、搜索，再往下看正文和表格。</p><div class="gallery-tools"><div class="view-switch" role="group" aria-label="样张显示方式"><button data-view="desktop" aria-pressed="true">桌面样张</button><button data-view="phone" aria-pressed="false">手机样张</button></div><span>完整样本会按你的屏幕自动适配</span></div></section><main class="design-grid">'''+''.join(cards)+'''</main><aside class="gallery-end"><div><b>先看顺不顺眼，再看好不好读。</b><p>每份样本都有完整首屏、地区入口、商品建议、正文表格和可展开来源。<br>选定主方向后，再把这套阅读体验应用到正式指南。</p></div><span>A / B / C / D</span></aside><footer class="gallery-footer">这轮仅为设计预览 · 正式站点未替换</footer></div></body></html>''')
